	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax a domino nostro Iesu Christo.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>En rursum ad vos venit, domine et frater in Christo suavissime, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>affinis noster <persName>Rotenbergius</persName> a <persName ref="p2809">Gothardo</persName><note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">Vermutlich <persName ref="p2809">Gotthard Richmut</persName>; s. <bibl source="b287">HBBW</bibl>; VIII 164, Anm. 76.</note> vestro debitum ex<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>torquendi ergo.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Profecto tardior est, quam ego credidissem, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>in exponendo id, quod tamen se facturum recepit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Credo <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>divitem illum animum ditiorem esse in animo quam marsupio, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>utcunque tamen sit, oro, ad solutionem illam tuam praestare <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>velis operam, atque admoneto illum, fidem ut servet etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Quę praeterea nurui nostrę cum amplissimo <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>senatu agenda sunt, pro amicitia nostra te adhortor, ut ad <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>finem deduci possint.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Constituit enim pro corporis sui <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>inevitabili quasi necessitate ad <placeName>Thermas</placeName> <placeName ref="l21">Badenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ineunte vere conferre se, hinc rursum ad patriam <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>postliminio ire; ita enim visum est nobis omnibus et Bullius <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>pię memorię ita ei quoque in mandatis dedit, ut se mor<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tuo ad suos sese rursum transferat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Utere igitur omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>eloquentię tę nervis et studio omni, quo potes, ut illum a <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>senatu lib... quibuscunque possis conditionibus; non enim manebit apud <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>vos.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sed hęc in sinum tu<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>um.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Nova, quę scribam, certe nulla habeo, nisi quod fama <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>spargitur in <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> et aliis circumiacentibus septentrionalibus <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>regionibus tacite magnum conscribi militem et equitem et <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>peditem, cuius tamen nomine, nondum constat; sunt, qui pu<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>tant marchionem <persName ref="p8371">Albertum</persName> moliri talia <placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> praesidio.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName>Anne</persName> verum sit, ego ignoro.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Dominus det ecclesię suę... <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>lem et hospitium extinctis omnibus tyrannis, qui nobis <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>foveas struunt.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Tu vale cum omnibus piis tuis sym<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>mistis et omnibus, qui ex animo promotam cupiunt veri verbi veritatem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Ex <placeName ref="l291">Lindavia</placeName> 7. februarii 1554.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2465">H<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ieronymus Pappus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Piissimo simul et vigilantissimo <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>pastori magistro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino ac fratri colendissimo<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8440">Gervasius Schuler</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, Lenzburg, 8. Februar 1554, ist am Ende des Jahrgangs eingeordnet</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
